### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{login_response.accessToken}}
@customerId = {{customer_response.id}}

### 1. Create Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "code": "CUST001",
  "name": "Metro Türkiye",
  "channel": "NKA",
  "type": "DIRECT",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "city": "Istanbul",
  "district": "Beşiktaş",
  "region": "Marmara",
  "country": "Turkey",
  "address": "Metro Plaza, Beşiktaş",
  "postalCode": "34349",
  "taxNumber": "1234567890",
  "taxOffice": "Beşiktaş",
  "contactPerson": "Ahmet Yılmaz",
  "contactEmail": "ahmet.yilmaz@metro.com.tr",
  "contactPhone": "+90 212 555 1234",
  "paymentTerms": "NET30",
  "creditLimit": 500000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "salesRepresentative": "John Doe",
  "accountManager": "Jane Smith",
  "customerGroup": "Modern Trade",
  "customerSegment": "Hypermarket",
  "customerTier": "A",
  "businessSize": "Large",
  "isVip": true,
  "metadata": {
    "storeSize": 5000,
    "numberOfEmployees": 200,
    "numberOfLocations": 15
  }
}

### 2. Create Multiple Customers (Bulk)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "customers": [
    {
      "code": "CUST002",
      "name": "Migros",
      "channel": "NKA",
      "type": "DIRECT",
      "city": "Istanbul"
    },
    {
      "code": "CUST003",
      "name": "CarrefourSA",
      "channel": "NKA",
      "type": "DIRECT",
      "city": "Istanbul"
    },
    {
      "code": "CUST004",
      "name": "A101",
      "channel": "NKA",
      "type": "DIRECT",
      "city": "Istanbul"
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Get All Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4. Get Customers with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?channel=NKA&city=Istanbul&status=ACTIVE&tier=A
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 5. Get Customers with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?page=1&limit=10&sortBy=name&sortOrder=ASC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 6. Search Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/search?q=Metro
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 7. Get Customer By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 8. Get Customer By Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/code/CUST001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 9. Update Customer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "customerTier": "A+",
  "creditLimit": 750000,
  "contactPerson": "Mehmet Demir",
  "contactEmail": "mehmet.demir@metro.com.tr"
}

### 10. Get Customers by Channel
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/channel/NKA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 11. Get Customers by City
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/city/Istanbul
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 12. Get VIP Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/vip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 13. Get Customer Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 14. Deactivate Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 15. Activate Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 16. Delete Customer (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

